using souls collected during every run. Souls are rewarded for defeating enemies, completing events and exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/d206a172380b645487e590c56e13ff0f.poster.avif?t=1757404618\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/d206a172380b645487e590c56e13ff0f.webm?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/d206a172380b645487e590c56e13ff0f.mp4?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Events for massive rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat mini bosses, claim a region, defeat powerful waves of enemies, or just defeat 100 duck sized enemies for big loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/c6fec8eb9670e39439d1ec65a188526f.poster.avif?t=1757404618\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/c6fec8eb9670e39439d1ec65a188526f.webm?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/c6fec8eb9670e39439d1ec65a188526f.mp4?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid inspired boss fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level culminates with a massive boss fight. Bosses each have unique abilities and multiple phases inspired by raid bosses in MMOs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/535419c7d0d06b567cc0d2255526265e.poster.avif?t=1757404618\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/535419c7d0d06b567cc0d2255526265e.webm?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/extras/535419c7d0d06b567cc0d2255526265e.mp4?t=1757404618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid to experiment with characters, attacks, and abilities. Runs are not meant to be more than 15 minutes long. So feel free to experiment without fear of washing hours down the drain because you made one bad decision early on.</p>","developers":["Ink Forged"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3928880","name":"Echoes of Light"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952430/0a1b5dadcefc3a50bb733094a7ee8b48fb347765/header.jpg?t=1757404618","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189864,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189864/movie480.mp4?t=1757123008","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189864/movie_max.mp4?t=1757123008"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189864/ecdfe6cac07c5279655843a678af0e20708b1cf5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757123008","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189864/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757123008","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189864/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757123008"}}],"name":"Echoes of Light Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_re